","source-block-389","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/01 BasicWaves",["Morph (BasicWaves)","Source"]],["p-4475c9dd4939dcde.html","source-block-109","Sub (BasicWaves)",[]],["p-4475c9dd4939dcde.html","source-block-130","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Shape while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/BasicWaves.",["Sub (BasicWaves)"]],["p-4475c9dd4939dcde.html","source-block-265","Adds a sine-wave sub-oscillator.",["Sub (BasicWaves)"]],["p-4475c9dd4939dcde.html","source-block-301","Source",["Sub (BasicWaves)"]],["p-4475c9dd4939dcde.html","source-block-314","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/01 BasicWaves",["Sub (BasicWaves)","Source"]],["p-4467e4dd492dcd63.html","source-block-109","Sym (BasicWaves)",[]],["p-4467e4dd492dcd63.html","source-block-130","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/BasicWaves.",["Sym (BasicWaves)"]],["p-4467e4dd492dcd63.html","source-block-266","Morphs between square-wave pulse width and phasing between the two sawtooth copies. It has no effect when Wave is at 50 (sawtooth).",["Sym (BasicWaves)"]],["p-4467e4dd492dcd63.html","source-block-401","Source",["Sym (BasicWaves)"]],["p-4467e4dd492dcd63.html","source-block-414","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/01 BasicWaves",["Sym (BasicWaves)","Source"]],["p-6f25377b1f0bb77c.html","source-block-201","BASS Oscillator (Bass)",[]],["p-6f25377b1f0bb77c.html","source-block-228","Oscillator model 14 of 22 on the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type, shown on the display as Bass.",["BASS Oscillator (Bass)"]],["p-6f25377b1f0bb77c.html","source-block-334","Parameters",["BASS Oscillator (Bass)"]],["p-6f25377b1f0bb77c.html","source-block-351","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/BASS/Saturate",["BASS Oscillator (Bass)","Parameters"]],["p-6f25377b1f0bb77c.html","source-block-451","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/BASS/Fold",["BASS Oscillator (Bass)","Parameters"]],["p-6f25377b1f0bb77c.html","source-block-549","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Shape → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/BASS/Noise",["BASS Oscillator (Bass)","Parameters"]],["p-6f25377b1f0bb77c.html","source-block-647","Source",["BASS Oscillator (Bass)"]],["p-6f25377b1f0bb77c.html","source-block-660","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/14 BASS",["BASS Oscillator (Bass)","Source"]],["p-0f7cbe7eee767a9e.html","source-block-103","Fold (Bass)",[]],["p-0f7cbe7eee767a9e.html","source-block-119","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/BASS.",["Fold (Bass)"]],["p-0f7cbe7eee767a9e.html","source-block-249","Applies a two-stage asymmetric fold that adds harmonics by folding parts of the wave that fall outside set boundaries back onto the wave. Don Buchla pioneered wavefolding in the early 1970s.",["Fold (Bass)"]],["p-0f7cbe7eee767a9e.html","source-block-443","Source",["Fold (Bass)"]],["p-0f7cbe7eee767a9e.html","source-block-456","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/14 BASS",["Fold (Bass)","Source"]],["p-2ae470e1aea9de35.html","source-block-103","Noise (Bass)",[]],["p-2ae470e1aea9de35.html","source-block-120","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Shape while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/BASS.",["Noise (Bass)"]],["p-2ae470e1aea9de35.html","source-block-249","Sets the noise level. Noise phase-modulates the two oscillators in opposite phases and is added between the fold stages.",["Noise (Bass)"]],["p-2ae470e1aea9de35.html","source-block-373","Source",["Noise (Bass)"]],["p-2ae470e1aea9de35.html","source-block-386","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/14 BASS",["Noise (Bass)","Source"]],["p-d1018ed113ac82c8.html","source-block-103","Saturate (Bass)",[]],["p-d1018ed113ac82c8.html","source-block-123","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/BASS.",["Saturate (Bass)"]],["p-d1018ed113ac82c8.html","source-block-251","Sets the saturation of the Cosine oscillator.",["Saturate (Bass)"]],["p-d1018ed113ac82c8.html","source-block-300","Source",["Saturate (Bass)"]],["p-d1018ed113ac82c8.html","source-block-313","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/14 BASS",["Saturate (Bass)","Source"]],["p-c2395f6bc15a3d58.html","source-block-205","Chords (Chords)",[]],["p-c2395f6bc15a3d58.html","source-block-225","Oscillator model 10 of 22 on the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type, shown on the display as Chords.",["Chords (Chords)"]],["p-c2395f6bc15a3d58.html","source-block-333","Parameters",["Chords (Chords)"]],["p-c2395f6bc15a3d58.html","source-block-350","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Chords/Type",["Chords (Chords)","Parameters"]],["p-c2395f6bc15a3d58.html","source-block-448","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Chords/Inv Transp",["Chords (Chords)","Parameters"]],["p-c2395f6bc15a3d58.html","source-block-554","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Shape → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Chords/Waveform",["Chords (Chords)","Parameters"]],["p-c2395f6bc15a3d58.html","source-block-657","Source",["Chords (Chords)"]],["p-c2395f6bc15a3d58.html","source-block-670","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/10 Chords",["Chords (Chords)","Source"]],["p-f9aaf908670f9186.html","source-block-105","Inv/Transp (Chords)",[]],["p-f9aaf908670f9186.html","source-block-129","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Chords.",["Inv/Transp (Chords)"]],["p-f9aaf908670f9186.html","source-block-261","Changes the chord inversion and frequency range. The chord stays the same, but the pitches are combined differently as the Timbre knob moves or is modulated externally.",["Inv/Transp (Chords)"]],["p-f9aaf908670f9186.html","source-block-433","Source",["Inv/Transp (Chords)"]],["p-f9aaf908670f9186.html","source-block-446","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/10 Chords